[1mThe one thing worth knowing about.[22m [38;5;10mc2MakeProxy[0m in the C has no [38;5;10mC2_TYPE_POLY[0m case, so it leaves the caller's proxy untouched — yet [38;5;10mc2CapsuletoPolyManifold[0m calls [38;5;10mc2GJK[0m with [38;5;10mC2_TYPE_POLY[0m, making [38;5;10mc2GJK[0m read an uninitialized stack local. This is reachable from the public API via any AABB↔capsule collision. It is genuine UB: under a deep stack (after [38;5;10mdlopen[0m or [38;5;10mprintf[0m) the garbage [38;5;10mcount[0m drives an out-of-bounds [38;5;10mc2Support[0m loop and the C library [1msegfaults[22m — 400/400 forked AABB↔capsule cases crashed.[0m[0m
